{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103042","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103042/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103042/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103042/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103042","id":2863811510,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6LxmaJ","number":103042,"title":"Replace editor renderer dropdown with icon next to version button","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":24,"created_at":"2025-02-19T16:16:15Z","updated_at":"2026-04-07T11:59:08Z","closed_at":"2026-04-07T11:58:58Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103042","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103042","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103042.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103042.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- Alternative to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103016.\r\n\r\nThe rendering driver is represented by the icon, while the rendering method is represented by its color (green for Forward+, purple for Mobile, blue for Compatibility).\r\n\r\nThis allows saving space at the top of the editor while providing more information than before on editor screenshots and videos, which is useful for technical support purposes. As a bonus, the rendering driver and method are now visible in the project manager.\r\n\r\nEditorVersionButton is now based on Button instead of LinkButton so that it can display an icon. However, this means its text is no longer underlined on hover.\r\n\r\nIn a future PR, we can also expand the usage of these icons to be displayed next to each project on the project list.\r\n\r\n- This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11806.\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\n### Forward+\r\n\r\nVulkan | Direct3D 12 | Metal\r\n-|-|-\r\n<img width=\"276\" height=\"27\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260318_232945\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/90050335-63b5-4090-909f-d2b43cc69edd\" /> | <img width=\"276\" height=\"27\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260318_233022\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c651c101-467b-4013-8803-deed608460d3\" /> | <img width=\"276\" height=\"27\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260318_233009\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8045cd6f-c11b-4e5f-8d7f-5e3df92b8a45\" />\r\n\r\n### Mobile\r\n\r\nVulkan | Direct3D 12 | Metal\r\n-|-|-\r\n<img width=\"276\" height=\"27\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260318_233110\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ad0330b-ecf4-4db2-ab9f-7f69849d31e9\" /> | <img width=\"276\" height=\"27\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260318_233040\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/be711c4a-ed1d-4382-80c1-baa51b023a83\" /> | <img width=\"276\" height=\"27\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260318_233056\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/518e3baf-1637-478a-8cb9-86488fadff2c\" />\r\n\r\n### Compatibility\r\n\r\n<img width=\"276\" height=\"27\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260318_232909\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e055c498-0a14-4fed-8e59-3f2ab18cfd50\" />\r\n\r\n### Mobile in the editor\r\n\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c48717ca-d6e9-4745-bf51-cece18c9ec82)\r\n\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/44339752-36bc-4f68-83f4-53cb696eef9c)\r\n\r\n### Forward+ in the project manager\r\n\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/88362ffe-2b67-417a-ab31-73e550faafd2)\r\n\r\n### Tooltip with rendering driver and method\r\n\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b3d8b839-cdb1-4424-8098-64e448af0278)\r\n\r\n## TODO\r\n\r\n- [x] Add icons for Vulkan, Metal, OpenGL, ~~OpenGL ES~~, ~~ANGLE~~ and use them.\r\n  - We could also use their respective official logos like we do for platforms, but ANGLE doesn't have an official logo and other logos may not scale well to a 16×16 pixel grid.\r\n  - Separate icons for OpenGL ES and ANGLE aren't really needed as per https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103042#issuecomment-2669142820.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103042/reactions","total_count":31,"+1":23,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":5,"heart":3,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103042/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}